cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Code for: Small-Scale Corrections to the Kirchhoff Approximation for Scattering from Multi-Scale Rough Dielectric Surfaces"
abstract: >-
  Python code that generates the figures of the Results section and the validation scripts of the paper. A smooth periodic
  dielectric profile is solved with the Kirchhoff approximation and the small scale is added with the method of variation
  of boundaries taken about the periodic surface (1D, TE and TM). The reference solutions are the Rayleigh method and an
  independent C-method solver.
